# API设计模式

## RESTful API设计

### HTTP控制器结构
使用 Fiber 框架构建 RESTful API：

```go
type Controller struct {
    usecase UseCase
    logger  *zerolog.Logger
}

func (c *Controller) RegisterRoutes(app *fiber.App) {
    api := app.Group("/api/v1")
    
    // 消息相关路由
    messages := api.Group("/messages")
    messages.Post("/", c.CreateMessage)
    messages.Get("/:id", c.GetMessage)
    messages.Put("/:id", c.UpdateMessage)
    messages.Delete("/:id", c.DeleteMessage)
    messages.Get("/", c.ListMessages)
}
```

### 统一响应格式
```go
type Response struct {
    Success bool        `json:"success"`
    Data    interface{} `json:"data,omitempty"`
    Error   string      `json:"error,omitempty"`
    Code    int         `json:"code"`
    Message string      `json:"message"`
}

type PaginatedResponse struct {
    Response
    Pagination *PaginationInfo `json:"pagination,omitempty"`
}
```

### 请求验证
使用 validator 进行输入验证：
```go
type CreateMessageRequest struct {
    Platform string `json:"platform" validate:"required,oneof=wecom dingtalk wechat"`
    ToUser   string `json:"to_user" validate:"required"`
    Content  string `json:"content" validate:"required,max=4096"`
    Type     string `json:"type" validate:"required,oneof=text image voice"`
}
```

## gRPC服务设计

### Protocol Buffer定义
在 `proto/` 目录中定义服务：

```protobuf
service MessageService {
    rpc SendMessage(SendMessageRequest) returns (SendMessageResponse);
    rpc GetMessage(GetMessageRequest) returns (GetMessageResponse);
    rpc ListMessages(ListMessagesRequest) returns (ListMessagesResponse);
}

message SendMessageRequest {
    string platform = 1;
    string to_user = 2;
    string content = 3;
    string type = 4;
    map<string, string> metadata = 5;
}
```

### gRPC控制器
```go
type GRPCController struct {
    usecase UseCase
